Q: css3 background radial circle gradient A: <pre><code>body {
  background: radial-gradient(circle, #1a0011, #000);
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  height: 100vh;
  margin: 0;
  font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
}

/* Card */
.card {
  width: 320px;
  height: 200px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff4081, #c2185b);
  border-radius: 20px;
  box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(255, 64, 129, 0.5);
  text-align: center;
  padding: 30px 20px;
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  animation: cardEnter 1s ease-out;
}

/* Light sweep (video feel) */
.shine {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: -100%;
  width: 50%;
  height: 100%;
  background: linear-gradient(
    120deg,
    transparent,
    rgba(255,255,255,0.4),
    transparent
  );
  animation: shineMove 2.5s infinite;
}

/* Main text */
.Happy__Birthday {
  font-size: 2.2em;
  font-weight: 700;
  background: linear-gradient(45deg, #fff, #ffe0f0);
  -webkit-background-clip: text;
  -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
  animation: textPop 0.8s ease-out;
}

/* Subtitle */
.sub {
  margin-top: 10px;
  font-size: 1em;
  color: #fff;
  opacity: 0;
  animation: fadeIn 1s ease-out forwards;
  animation-delay: 0.8s;
}

/* Animations */
@keyframes cardEnter {
  from {
    transform: scale(0.7) rotateX(30deg);
    opacity: 0;
  }
  to {
    transform: scale(1) rotateX(0);
    opacity: 1;
  }
}

@keyframes textPop {
  0% { transform: scale(0.6); opacity: 0; }
  100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
}

@keyframes fadeIn {
  to { opacity: 1; }
}

@keyframes shineMove {
  0% { left: -100%; }
  100% { left: 150%; }
}
</code></pre>
